; https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/master/pages/common/jj-operation-abandon.md

% jj-operation-abandon, common

# Abandon a specific operation
jj <_op_operation_> abandon <operation_id>

# Abandon a specific operation and all of its ancestors
jj <_op_operation_> abandon ..<operation_id>

# Discard recent operations after restoring to an earlier state
jj <_op_operation_> abandon <operation_id>..@-
